<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Samsonite started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Samsonite Corp as a buy and set a price target of $60 a share, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
